@*
    _BrandSidebarHeader.cshtml — Spec 019 FR-025 sidebar brand header.

    Renders teal seedling mark + "Programa Semilla" wordmark.
    Collapsed sidebar (Tabler default 992 px breakpoint per research R4)
    surfaces the wordmark via the title attribute as a hover tooltip.

    Preserves spec-017 FR-016 sidebar data-testid slugs at the parent <aside>
    level (this partial only renders the brand header subtree); the wordmark
    text "Programa Semilla" is the FR-033 brand-presence assertion target
    (visible to E2E tests).
*@
<a class="fl-sidebar-brand"
   href="@(Url.Action("Index", "Home") ?? "/")"
   title="Programa Semilla"
   data-testid="sidebar-brand">
    <img src="~/lib/brand/mark.svg" class="fl-sidebar-brand-mark" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />
    <span class="fl-sidebar-brand-wordmark">Programa Semilla</span>
</a>
